B.Yh=new A.bu("The Little Red Hen","Classic Folk Tale","Once there was a little red hen. She lived on a farm. She found some seeds on the ground. She asked her friends to help her plant the seeds. The cat said no. The dog said no. The duck said no. So the little red hen did it all by herself.")
B.Y8=new A.bu("The Three Bears","Classic Folk Tale","Once upon a time there were three bears. There was a big papa bear, a mama bear, and a tiny baby bear. They lived in a little house in the woods. One day they made some soup for lunch. It was too hot to eat so they went for a walk.")
B.Ym=new A.bu("The Ugly Duckling","Hans Christian Andersen","A mother duck sat on her eggs. One by one they began to crack. Out came little yellow ducklings. But the last egg was big. When it cracked, out came a gray bird. He did not look like the others. They called him ugly. But he did not give up hope.")
B.Y2=new A.bu("The Tortoise and the Hare","Aesop's Fables","A hare made fun of a slow tortoise. The tortoise said he could win a race. The hare laughed but said yes. The race began. The hare ran fast then took a nap. The tortoise kept going slow and steady. He won the race while the hare slept.")
B.Yv=new A.bu("Jack and the Beanstalk","English Fairy Tale","Jack lived with his mother. They were very poor. One day Jack sold their cow for magic beans. His mother was upset and threw the beans out the window. The next day a huge beanstalk grew up to the sky. Jack climbed up to see what was at the top.")
B.Y5=new A.bu("The Gingerbread Man","Classic Folk Tale","An old woman made a gingerbread man. When she opened the oven, he jumped out and ran. Run, run, as fast as you can. You cannot catch me, I am the gingerbread man. He ran past the cow and the horse.")
B.XN=new A.bu("The Boy Who Cried Wolf","Aesop's Fables","A boy watched over the sheep on a hill. He was bored so he cried out that a wolf was coming. The people in the town ran to help but there was no wolf. He did it again the next day. When a real wolf came, no one came to help him.")
B.Ys=new A.bu("The Ant and the Dove","Aesop's Fables","An ant fell into a stream. A dove saw the ant. The dove dropped a leaf into the water. The ant climbed on the leaf and was safe. Later a man tried to catch the dove. The ant bit the man on the foot. The dove flew away.")
B.XR=new A.bu("The Lion and the Mouse","Aesop's Fables","A lion caught a tiny mouse. The mouse begged him to let go. The lion laughed but set the mouse free. One day the lion got caught in a big net. The little mouse heard him roar. She came and chewed through the ropes to free him.")
B.Yn=new A.bu("The Elves and the Shoemaker","Brothers Grimm","A poor shoemaker had only enough leather for one pair of shoes. He cut the leather and went to bed. In the morning he found a perfect pair of shoes. Someone had made them in the night. He sold the shoes and bought more leather.")
B.XZ=new A.bu("The Three Little Pigs","Classic Folk Tale","Three little pigs left home to build their own houses. The first pig built a house of straw. The second pig built a house of sticks. The third pig built a house of bricks. A big bad wolf came and blew down the first two houses. But he could not blow down the house of bricks.")
B.XP=new A.bu("The Fox and the Grapes","Aesop's Fables","A fox saw some ripe grapes hanging from a vine. He wanted to eat them very much. He jumped and jumped but could not reach them. At last the fox walked away. He said the grapes were sour and not worth eating.")
B.Ya=new A.bu("Little Red Riding Hood","Classic Folk Tale","A girl in a red hood went to visit her grandma. Her mother told her to stay on the path. She walked through the dark woods with a basket of food. She sang a song as she walked along. The birds and squirrels watched her from the trees.")
B.Yk=new A.bu("The Magic Porridge Pot","Brothers Grimm","A kind girl got a magic pot from an old woman. When she said cook, the pot made sweet porridge. When she said stop, the pot would stop. One day her mother forgot the magic word. The porridge filled the house and flowed into the street.")
B.XM=new A.bu("Stone Soup","Classic Folk Tale","A traveler came to a village with only a stone. He put water in a big pot and dropped the stone in. He said he was making stone soup. The villagers each added a vegetable to help. Soon they had made a wonderful soup to share.")
B.Yx=new A.bu("The Golden Goose","Brothers Grimm","A kind boy shared his lunch with an old man in the woods. The old man told him to chop down a tree. Inside the tree the boy found a goose with golden feathers. Everyone who touched the goose got stuck to it. The boy walked to town with a funny parade behind him.")
B.Yd=new A.bu("The City Mouse and the Country Mouse","Aesop's Fables","A city mouse went to visit his cousin in the country. The country mouse shared his simple beans and corn. Then they went to the city to eat cake and cheese. But a big cat chased them from the feast. The country mouse said a safe home beats a fancy meal.")
B.Y4=new A.bu("The Princess and the Pea","Hans Christian Andersen","One stormy night a girl knocked on the castle door. She said she was a real princess, soaked by the rain. The queen hid a tiny pea under twenty soft beds. In the morning the girl said she could not sleep at all. Only a true princess could feel a pea through twenty beds.")
